        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Strictly Keccak-256 — the pre-FIPS-202 original Keccak padding that Ethereum mandates — not standardized SHA3-256; pysha3's keccak_256() and the maandree/sha3sum binary both implement that variant, and the variant is protocol-fixed (EIP-55 / address derivation), so it is not negotiable here. Hashes hold up against Grover; no confidentiality decision rides on this digest. All eight sites seen — all three files read end-to-end."
